  <ThingDef ParentName="ApparelArmorReconSolarBase">
    <defName>BOR_Solar_Apparel_ArmorRecon</defName>
    <label>solar recon armor</label>
    <description>Partially-powered armor, designed for mobility and ease-of-use. Meshes of Sunsteel Weave block attacks without adding excessive weight, and a complex endomuscular system in the lower body allows for uncompromised movement.\n\nArmor such as this is often employed by solar scout troops and higher-end police forces.</description>
    <apparel>
